  "description": "After her family was wiped out, Mo-Ryeon sought refuge at the home of her father’s close friend, but she spent her days in loneliness, tormented by a sense of rootlessness. In the midst of those hopeless days, a shadow crept over the wall and slipped into her room. “I’m here, Mo-Ryeon.” With a slow, sly smile, he reached beneath her skirt. People would never know. They have no idea just how relentless and depraved Han Yu-Baek, the man they praise, truly is.\n\n *“Were you trying to run away to a place where I couldn’t find you? You can never escape my embrace. Not then, not now, and not ever.”*\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
